32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Seashell_Shimmering_2_60b97b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><br/>You can get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shimmering%20Pearl\">Shimmering Pearl</a> from it if you have the corresponding mission open of the <a href=\"#/quest/within-the-tides-quest\">Within the Tides Quest</a>, but the pearl is not required for the quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shimmering%20Pearl\">Shimmering Pearl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/within-the-tides-quest\">Within the Tides Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["within-the-tides-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"within-the-tides-quest","quest":"Within the Tides Quest","step":"3-7","n":50,"title":"Moonshine Pearl","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33883,"y":32740,"z":7,"label":"Vórtice para a Moonshine Pearl"}]}],"spots":[{"x":33655,"y":32763,"z":8,"text":"At the Temple of the Moon Goddess behind a closed door, here ."}]}}